title: Rose Window
text: Yellow glass in the window, and not a yellow filter in sight.
trick: one prism is lit by two white beams at once, from below and from the south-east; the red of one and the green of the other leave together as yellow, twice, and the prism swallows both blues
motif: symmetric frame
expect: merges>=1
proof: not proved; no other solution found in 300 s
